  "post_title": "Candidatura del PSPV-PSOE a l'Ajuntament de Suera",
  "post_date": "2015-05-04 16:50:26",
  "post_name": "candidatura-del-psoe-a-lajuntament-de-suera",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Noticias|Política",
  "post_content": "<p>Aquest cap de setmana s&#39;ha presentat al sal&oacute; de la Font Seca la candidatura del PSPV-PSOE a l&#39;Ajuntament de Suera, encap&ccedil;alada una vegada m&eacute;s per l&#39;actual alcalde, Jos&eacute; Pascual Mart&iacute; Garc&iacute;a, que aspira a revalidar l&#39;alcaldia que ocupa durant vuit anys.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/05/IMG_5758.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>Al final de l&#39;acte ha intervingut Antonio Lorenzo G&oacute;rriz, membre de l&#39;executiva nacional del PSPV-PSOE i integrant de la candidatura socialista a l&#39;Ajuntament de Castell&oacute;. A m&eacute;s de l&#39;alcaldable Mart&iacute;, tamb&eacute; han parlat Miriam Arrandis Garcia i Jos&eacute; Calatayud Montoliu, que actualment ocupen tinences d&#39;alcaldia a l&#39;Ajuntament de Suera.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/05/IMG_5747.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>Tamb&eacute; estaven presentes a l&#39;acte Vicente Juan Prades Ramos, nou candidat del PSPV-PSOE a l&#39;alcaldia de Tales, Juan Jos&eacute; Orcajada Pradas, a la d&#39;Ay&oacute;dar, Asunci&oacute;n Capilla Tamborero, a la de Fuentes de Ay&oacute;dar, aix&iacute; com integrants de les seues candidatures. Igualment, el senador Enrique Navarro Andreu o el diputat provincial i secretari general socialista a la comarca de la Plana Baixa, Juan Miguel Salvador P&eacute;rez, amdd&oacute;s d&#39;Onda.</p>\n<p>La candidatura completa del PSPV-PSOE a l&#39;Ajuntament de Suera &eacute;s la seg&uuml;ent:</p>\n<p>1. JOS&Eacute; PASCUAL MART&Iacute; GARC&Iacute;A<br />\n 2. JOSE CALATAYUD MONTOLIU<br />\n 3. MIRIAM ARRANDIS GARCIA<br />\n 4. JOSE MANUEL PALLARES PALANQUES<br />\n 5. FERMI CANOS SERRANO<br />\n 6. GILDA NAE<br />\n 7. LLUIS GARCIA SERRANO<br />\n Suplentes<br />\n 1. JESUS GARCIA TALAYA<br />\n 2. ANGELES FABREGAT GARGALLO<br />\n 3. SANTIAGO MOLINER SERRANO</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllistamunicipalpsoesuera15/img_5666.jpg\" alt=\"img_5666\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllistamunicipalpsoesuera15/img_5668.jpg\" alt=\"img_5668\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllistamunicipalpsoesuera15/img_5670.jpg\" alt=\"img_5670\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllistamunicipalpsoesuera15/img_5673.jpg\" alt=\"img_5673\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllistamunicipalpsoesuera15/img_5674.jpg\" alt=\"img_5674\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllistamunicipalpsoesuera15/img_5676.jpg\" alt=\"img_5676\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllistamunicipalpsoesuera15/img_5677.jpg\" alt=\"img_5677\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllistamunicipalpsoesuera15/img_5680.jpg\" alt=\"img_5680\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllistamunicipalpsoesuera15/img_5682.jpg\" alt=\"img_5682\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllistamunicipalpsoesuera15/img_5684.jpg\" alt=\"img_5684\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllistamunicipalpsoesuera15/img_5686.jpg\" alt=\"img_5686\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715